            {
              "title": "Likes and Dislikes at School",
              "weight": 4,
              "content": [
                {
                  "order": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "{\"time\":1700009004000,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"bB8cC9dD0e\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"We use these phrases to express <b>likes</b> and <b>dislikes</b> about school subjects:\"}},{\"id\":\"eE1fF2gG3h\",\"type\":\"list\",\"data\":{\"style\":\"unordered\",\"items\":[\"I <b>love</b> English! — Я обожаю английский!\",\"I <b>like</b> Art. — Мне нравится искусство.\",\"I <b>don't mind</b> History. — История мне ничего.\",\"I <b>don't like</b> Chemistry. — Мне не нравится химия.\",\"I <b>hate</b> Maths! — Я ненавижу математику!\"]}},{\"id\":\"hH4iI5jJ6k\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Giving a reason:</b>\"}},{\"id\":\"kK7lL8mM9n\",\"type\":\"list\",\"data\":{\"style\":\"unordered\",\"items\":[\"I like English <b>because</b> it is interesting. — потому что это интересно.\",\"I don't like Maths <b>because</b> it is difficult. — потому что это сложно.\"]}}],\"version\":\"2.31.4\"}"
                },
                {
                  "order": 2,
                  "type": "audio",
                  "content": {
                    "text": "I love English because it is interesting. I don't like Maths because it is difficult.",
                    "type": "tts",
                    "audio_url": ""
                  }
                },
