              "type": "text",
              "content": "{\"time\":1700009009000,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"kK8lL9mM0n\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Here are common <b>questions and answers</b> about school:\"}},{\"id\":\"nN1oO2pP3q\",\"type\":\"list\",\"data\":{\"style\":\"unordered\",\"items\":[\"<b>What school do you go to?</b> — В какую школу ты ходишь?\",\"<b>What year are you in?</b> — В каком ты классе?\",\"<b>What is your favourite subject?</b> — Какой твой любимый предмет?\",\"<b>Who is your English teacher?</b> — Кто твой учитель английского?\",\"<b>How many lessons do you have today?</b> — Сколько у тебя сегодня уроков?\",\"<b>Do you have homework?</b> — У тебя есть домашнее задание?\"]}},{\"id\":\"qQ4rR5sS6t\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Example answers:</b>\"}},{\"id\":\"tT7uU8vV9w\",\"type\":\"list\",\"data\":{\"style\":\"unordered\",\"items\":[\"I go to <b>City School Number 5</b>.\",\"I am in <b>Year 7</b>.\",\"My favourite subject is <b>English</b>.\",\"I have <b>six</b> lessons today.\",\"Yes, I have homework in Maths.\"]}}],\"version\":\"2.31.4\"}"
